# Secrets that must NEVER land in an image layer — the Dockerfile's
# `COPY . .` would otherwise bake them in.  Google service-account keys
# have been named both semi-telematics-*.json and truck-*.json; a bare
# *.json is too broad (locale/config files), so match the key shapes.
semi-telematics-*.json
truck-*.json
*-service-account*.json

# Docs, Claude Code config, editor state — never belong in the image
# build context (the app serves nothing from them; docs/ alone is MBs).
docs/
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
